@startuml pattern-template-method
!include _style.iuml
title Template Method — TransitAgent.run()
!include model.iuml
remove *
restore TransitAgent
restore TripRequestAgent
restore AlertInterpreterAgent
restore ExplanationAgent
restore PreferenceExtractorAgent
note as N1
<b>run()</b> is final and fixes the agent loop:
1. buildMessages(req)
2. llm.complete(msgs, tools, systemPrompt())
3. while tool calls and round < maxToolRounds:
   execute via ToolRegistry, append results
4. output = parseFinal(response, ctx)
5. report = validate(output, ctx)
6. valid ? success : onInvalid(report, req)
end note
N1 .. TransitAgent
@enduml
